{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to &quot;Air Combat: Overheat&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for exciting air battles! &quot;Air Combat: Overheat&quot; is a 2D Roguelike game full of challenges and fun. Become a brave pilot, fly your favorite plane, and show your skills against endless enemies and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to my discord :\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exciting Air Battles</strong>: Fight various enemies and enjoy the thrilling combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Items and Upgrades</strong>: Buy items and upgrade skills after each battle to make your plane stronger and unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overheat System</strong>: Watch your plane's heat levels. If it gets too hot, performance drops and it takes damage. Manage heat wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various Planes</strong>: From nimble scouts to powerful fighters, pick the plane that suits your style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss Fights</strong>: Face strong bosses and use your strategy and skills to defeat them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Maps</strong>: Explore beautiful maps, each with its own challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly your plane, keep it cool, and face every enemy in the air to become the top air combat hero!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1590390?t=1741446955","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1590390?t=1741446955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/49a90548175f731fff5e5704cf50897cdb2f2dd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741446955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/49a90548175f731fff5